  "title": "Homemade Tomato Sauce",
  "description": "This homemade tomato sauce made with vine tomatoes, caramelized onions, and bell pepper is richly flavored with garlic, fresh basil, and red wine.",
  "authors": [
    "MOLSON7"
  ],
